   "solution_en": "<p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>=&gt; a = 0 and b = 0</p><p>(4x  -  7y)<sup>2</sup> + (5y  -  3z)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>4x  -  7y = 0</p><p>4x = 7y</p><p>x : y = 7 : 4........(i)</p><p>5y  -  3z = 0</p><p>5y = 3z</p><p>y : z = 3 : 5.......(ii)</p><p>multiply eq(i) by 3 and eq(ii) by 4 we get,</p><p>x : y : z = 21 : 12 : 20</p>",
