   "solution_en": "<p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 266 = 2(9a + 8b  -  11c)</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 266 = 18a + 16b  -  22c</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>  -  18a + b<sup>2</sup>  -  16b + c<sup>2</sup> + 22c + 266 = 0</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> -18a + 81 + b<sup>2</sup> + 64  -  16b + c<sup>2</sup> + 121 + 22c = 0</p><p>(a  -  9)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  8)<sup>2</sup> + (c + 11)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>a = 9, b = 8 and c = -11</p><p>(ab  -  bc  -  ca)  -  128 = (9*8  -  (8 * -11)  -  (-11 * 9)  -  128</p><p>=&gt; (72 + 88 + 99)  -  128 = 259  -  128</p><p>=&gt; 131</p>",
