   "q_en": "<p>If &#945; + &#946; + &#947; = 0, then (5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#947;<sup>2</sup>)/( 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;) = ?</p>",
