   "solution_en": "<p>&#945; + &#946; + &#947; = 0</p><p>&#947; = - (&#945; + &#946;)</p><p>substitute &#947; = -(&#945; + &#946;) into the formula :</p><p>{5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + [-(&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>]/{ 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;}</p><p>=&gt; [5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>] / {6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;}</p><p>=&gt; (5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#945;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/( 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; (5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/( 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; (6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946;)/(6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; (6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)/(6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; 1</p>",
