  {
   "q_en": "<p>If 2a + 4b + 5c = 0, then what is the value of (8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>) ?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2a + 4b + 5c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "90abc",
    "100abc",
    "120abc",
    "125abc"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "90&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;",
    "100&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;",
    "120&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;",
    "125&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;"
   ],
   "answer": 2,
   "solution_en": "<p>We use the identity for the sum of cubes: a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc</p><p>=&gt; (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> - ab - bc - ca)</p><p><b>Formula Used:</b></p><p>8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  3(2a)(4b)(5c) = (2a + 4b + 5c)[(2a)<sup>2</sup> + (4b)<sup>2</sup> + (5c)<sup>2</sup>  -  (2a)(4b) - (4b)(5c) - (5c)(2a)]</p><p><b>Calculation:</b></p><p>We have,</p><p>=&gt; 2a + 4b + 5c = 0</p><p>Using the formula for the sum of cubes, we get:</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  120abc = (2a + 4b + 5c)(4a<sup>2</sup> + 16b<sup>2</sup> + 25c<sup>2</sup> - 8ab - 20bc - 10ca)</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  120abc = 0</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup> = 120abc</p><p><b>The value of 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup> is 120abc.</b></p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>We use the identity for the sum of cubes: a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc</p><p>=&gt; (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> - ab - bc - ca)</p><p><b>Formula Used:</b></p><p>8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  3(2a)(4b)(5c) = (2a + 4b + 5c)[(2a)<sup>2</sup> + (4b)<sup>2</sup> + (5c)<sup>2</sup>  -  (2a)(4b) - (4b)(5c) - (5c)(2a)]</p><p><b>Calculation:</b></p><p>We have,</p><p>=&gt; 2a + 4b + 5c = 0</p><p>Using the formula for the sum of cubes, we get:</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  120abc = (2a + 4b + 5c)(4a<sup>2</sup> + 16b<sup>2</sup> + 25c<sup>2</sup> - 8ab - 20bc - 10ca)</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  120abc = 0</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup> = 120abc</p><p><b>The value of 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup> is 120abc.</b></p>",
