   "solution_en": "<p>(a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc) = 1/2 (a + b + c) [(a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup>]</p><p>=&gt; 330 = 1/2  X  11 (a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup>.</p><p>=&gt; (a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup> = 660/11</p><p>=&gt; (a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup> = 60</p>",
