  {
   "q_en": "<p>If a  -  b  -  c = 0, then [(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4</sup> = ?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a - b - c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; [(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4</sup> = ?</p>",
