   "solution_en": "<p>a  -  b  -  c = 0</p><p>a  -  c = b</p><p>squaring both sides we get,</p><p>(a  -  c)<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  2ac = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>by adding b<sup>2</sup> to both sides we get,</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = 2b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac) = 2</p><p>[(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4 </sup>= 2<sup>4</sup></p><p>=&gt; 16</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>a  -  b  -  c = 0</p><p>a  -  c = b</p><p>squaring both sides we get,</p><p>(a  -  c)<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  2ac = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>by adding b<sup>2</sup> to both sides we get,</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = 2b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac) = 2</p><p>[(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4 </sup>= 2<sup>4</sup></p><p>=&gt; 16</p>",
