  {
   "q_en": "<p>If x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, then find x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5 &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "1",
    "2",
    "4",
    "6"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "1",
    "2",
    "4",
    "6"
   ],
   "answer": 3,
   "solution_en": "<p>Formula used :</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx)</p><p>And x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>Given,</p><p>1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1</p><p>(yz + xz + xy)/xyz = 1</p><p>(yz+ xz + xy) = 1</p><p>x + y + z = 1</p><p>squaring both sides,</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = 1<sup>2</sup></p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx) = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 1 = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 1  -  2 = - 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup><sub> </sub>= (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>=&gt; 1 * (-1  -  1) + 3 = -2 + 3 = 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5 = 1 + 5 = 6</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Formula used :</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx)</p><p>And x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>Given,</p><p>1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1</p><p>(yz + xz + xy)/xyz = 1</p><p>(yz+ xz + xy) = 1</p><p>x + y + z = 1</p><p>squaring both sides,</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = 1<sup>2</sup></p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx) = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 1 = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 1  -  2 = - 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup><sub> </sub>= (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>=&gt; 1 * (-1  -  1) + 3 = -2 + 3 = 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5 = 1 + 5 = 6</p>",
