   "q_en": "<p>What is the value of (1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c) if, [(4a  -  9)/a]  -  [(5b  -  9)/b] + [(3c + 9)/c] = 0?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>(1/a - 1/b - 1/c) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367;, [(4a - 9)/a] - [(5b - 9)/b] + [(3c + 9)/c] = 0?</p>",
